s4gppg","name":"Lucas","price":"800","status":"quoted","notes":"£800 up to 4 hours 200 photos\n\n\nHi Graeme,\n\nThank you for getting in touch, and congratulations on your upcoming wedding!\n\nI'm happy to let you know that I am available on 5th December 2026 and would love to photograph your ceremony.\n\nFrom what you've described, with the ceremony followed by photos at various locations around Edinburgh, 3–4 hours of coverage sounds like it would work well.\n\nPlease have a look at the wedding photography packages available on my website and let me know which one best suits your plans. If you're unsure, I'd be happy to recommend the most suitable package based on your timeline and requirements.\n\nCould you also let me know what time your ceremony is due to start? As your wedding is in December, daylight is quite limited, so the ceremony time will play an important part in planning your photography. If you're hoping to visit several locations around Edinburgh after the ceremony, it's worth keeping in mind that it gets dark fairly early at that time of year.\n\nI was also wondering what you mean by \"various locations around Edinburgh.\" Do you already have specific places in mind for your couple portraits, or are you looking for recommendations? I'd be happy to suggest some beautiful locations depending on the style of photos you're after.\n\nIf you'd like to go ahead with the booking, I'll require a deposit to secure your wedding date in my diary. Once the deposit has been received, your date will be fully reserved.\n\nIf you have any questions or would like to discuss your plans in more detail, please don't hesitate to get in touch.\n\nI look forward to hearing from you.\n\n","link":"https://lucasweddingphotography.co.uk/packages/"},{"id":"bkcjfy67","name":"Kris Soul","price":"590","status":"rejected","notes":" up to 4 h - USB with approx. 180-280 edited images (colour, B&W, sepia)\nDigital Package 3 - £690 ( Fri - Sun) - £630 ( Mon - Thu )\n- up to 6 h - USB 