ci, e marinelia, drakes, sam hober, npeal\nCoat - Walker and Slater. "},{"id":"o4y2747c","date":"2026-07-29","text":"https://nataliaswiader.com/guide/edinburgh-elopement-guide/#timberyard-restaurant\ngood Edinburgh planning resource ","type":"note"},{"id":"4dy53jua","date":"2026-08-10","text":"Bouqet charm - gran photo\nAlgerian love knot bracelet or ear rings\n","type":"note"}],"script":[{"id":"t8fu81i2","title":"Processional","content":""},{"id":"dcqon6s4","title":"Welcome & opening words","content":""},{"id":"4msqlkp4","title":"Reading(s)","content":"See the Readings section below for full text."},{"id":"cyzorapv","title":"The vows","content":"See Personal vows below."},{"id":"6b0dinr5","title":"Ring exchange (if applicable)","content":""},{"id":"ephf07m5","title":"Pronouncement","content":""},{"id":"lb5ryid4","title":"Signing (if legal ceremony)","content":""},{"id":"eiy1npht","title":"Recessional","content":""}],"vows":{"aName":"Partner 1","aText":"","bName":"Partner 2","bText":""},"readings":[],"emails":{"Ceremony location":{"subject":"Enquiry — intimate ceremony, 5 December, 6 guests","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're planning an intimate name-changing ceremony in Edinburgh on 5 December, with just 6 people total including a celebrant. We're drawn to your venue and wanted to check:\n\n- Availability on 5 December\n- Whether you host ceremonies of this size (relaxed, not a traditional wedding)\n- Approximate cost for a 1–2 hour booking\n- Whether outside celebrants are permitted\n- Any restrictions around photography\n\nWe'd love to hear more about what's possible.\n\nThank you,\n"},"Celebrant":{"subject":"Enquiry — celebrant for intimate ceremony, 5 December","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're having a symbolic ceremony in Edinburgh on 5 December — an intimate gathering of 6 people. We loved the tone of your ceremonies and wanted to ask:\n\n- Your availability on 5 December\n- Whether you're able to lead a personalised, relaxed ceremony (readings, own vows, ring exchange)\n- Your fee and what's included\n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nThank you,\n"},"Accommodation":{"subject":"Booking enquiry — 4–5 December, small group","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're looking to book accommodation in Edinburgh for the nights around 4–5 December, for our ceremony weekend. Could you let us know:\n\n- Availability for those dates\n- Room options and rates\n- Whether a later checkout on 5 December would be possible (getting ready for a ceremony that day)\n\nThank you,\n"},"Photographer":{"subject":"Enquiry — elopement-style coverage, Edinburgh, 5 December","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're having an intimate name-changing ceremony in Edinburgh on 5 December (6 people total) and love your elopement/micro-wedding work. Could you let us know:\n\n- Availability on 5 December\n- Packages and approximate pricing for a few hours' coverage\n- Whether you have experience shooting in Edinburgh in winter light\n- Turnaround time for edited images\n\nPlease email your response.\n\nThank you,\n"},"Flowers":{"subject":"Enquiry — small ceremony florals, 5 December","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're planning a small, intimate ceremony in Edinburgh on 5 December and are looking for simple, seasonal florals — likely a bouquet and a buttonhole or two. Could you share:\n\n- Availability for 5 December\n- Approximate pricing for a small order like this\n- What's in season in early December\n\nThank you,\n"},"Transport":{"subject":"Enquiry — transport for small ceremony party, 5 December","body":"Hello,\n\nWe need transport in Edinburgh on 5 December for a small ceremony party (up to 6 people), likely between accommodation, ceremony location and a restaurant. Could you share:\n\n- Availability on 5 December\n- Vehicle options for this group size\n- Approximate pricing for a few short journeys across the day\n\nThank you,\n"},"Restaurant":{"subject":"Private dining enquiry — 6 covers, evening of 5 December","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're celebrating an intimate ceremony in Edinburgh and would love to book a private or semi-private space for 6 people on the evening of 5 December. Could you let us know:\n\n- Availability that evening\n- Options for private/set dining for a small group\n- Approximate cost per head\n- Whether you could accommodate a short toast/speech\n\nThank you,\n"},"Stationary":{"subject":"Enquiry — Stationary, 5 December, Edinburgh","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're planning an intimate name-changing ceremony in Edinburgh on 5 December, with 6 people total. We're getting in touch about stationary and wanted to check:\n\n- Availability on 5 December\n- Approximate pricing\n- Anything you'd need from us to confirm\n\nThank you,\n"},"Misc":{"subject":"Enquiry — Misc, 5 December, Edinburgh","body":"Hello,\n\nWe're planning an intimate name-changing ceremony in Edinburgh on 5 December, with 6 people total. We're getting in touch about misc and wanted to check:\n\n- Availability on 5 December\n- Approximate pricing\n- Anything you'd need from us to confirm\n\nThank you,\n"}},"guests":[{"id":"o673gbxa","name":"Sheila Elliott","notes":"","dietary":"Gluten Free","rsvp":"yes"},{"id":"m069ne21","name":"John Elliott","notes":"","dietary":"Diabetic","rsvp":"yes"},{"id":"dp7ay1u7","name":"Derek Smith ","notes":"","dietary":"Normal","rsvp":"yes"},{"id":"8ig4a8pr","name":"Sue Smith ","notes":"","dietary":"swallowing  issues","rsvp":"yes"}],"share":{"dress":"","rsvp":"","contact":"","accom":"Kimpton Charlotte ","extra":""},"navOrder":["overview","checklist","budget","photos","script","timeline","guests","decisions","research"],"photoLocations":[{"id":"5lll523s","name":"Kimpton Charlotte","distance":"","status":"idea","tags":[],"notes":"","weather":"","link":"","images":[{"id":"zhqqqbpl","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ddc0fd543c7db33b50afbad/1676456350215-KCNQUVZJEOBNW2IDRI27/2023-02-15_0023.jpg?format=2500w"},{"id":"1tr5fom9","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ddc0fd543c7db33b50afbad/1676456463812-UEF2IVCP4VQS9F7F6N19/2023-02-15_002